---
/* The floating navigation, after fluid.glass: surfaces at the foot of the
   screen, centred, there on every page from the moment it has loaded.

   The bar: a dark, translucent rectangle holding the home link, the page's
   name and the menu control, with the close control and a back-to-top arrow
   waiting below its edge, clipped. Its background is its own element, so it
   can narrow to a square around the close control without moving anything
   on it.

   The menu: a set of separate modules standing just above the bar, close
   together, with no panel round them: the four parts of the practice as
   tiles, two by two, each with the part it stands for under its name;
   Home across the full width under them; and at the foot one row of two:
   the Play Reel card, two thirds of the width, which grows into the
   reel's player when pressed (reel.js), and Contact Tom, the last third,
   in the off-white. Each module is its own surface, the dark ones a shade
   apart from their neighbours; they rise into place from the bar, row by
   row, as the menu opens.

   The contact form: Contact Tom turns the menu itself into a panel holding
   a short enquiry form (name, company, email, the project): the menu's
   blocks give way, its panel reshapes into the form's, and the form's
   fields rise in; closing runs it back into the menu. Every other way to
   contact Tom on the site (the bar at the top's Let's talk, the footer's
   Start a project and Get in touch) opens the same form, grown out of the
   bar, and closing takes it back into the bar. floatingnav.js moves it,
   enquiry.js checks and sends it (to the address in contact.ts).

   The marquees: a narrow strip just above the bar and as wide as it,
   running a line on a loop. One strip per message, each up only where the
   page, or the part of it on screen, asks for it (data-nav-promo, read by
   floatingnav.js): the book's, in the colours of the Architectural
   Influence cover, a book between its titles that opens under the pointer,
   leading to the book (the Influence page, where it grows into the band at
   the head of the book section as that comes up, influence.js); and Contact
   Tom's, on the off-white, opening the contact form (the home page, below
   its hero). Changing message, one strip goes back behind the bar as the
   other comes up, each still running; they go back while the menu is open
   or a page transition runs.

   Lives in the layout, outside the Barba container, so it survives a
   navigation; floatingnav.js binds it once, ties the bar to each page's
   footer, and takes the page's name and section from the container
   (data-nav-title, data-nav-section, BaseLayout.astro). Styles: "Floating
   navigation" in style.css. */
import { pages, email } from './site-links';
import { CONTACT_ENDPOINT } from './contact';
import { REEL_SRC, REEL_FALLBACK_POSTER, reelPoster, reelPreview, reelPreviewSmall } from './reel';
import { urlFor } from '../sanity/image';
import BookIcon from './BookIcon.astro';
import BrandMark from './BrandMark.astro';

const tiles = ['/architecture', '/influence', '/shop', '/partner'].flatMap((href) => pages.filter((page) => page.href === href));
const home = pages.find((page) => page.href === '/')!;
// The reel's card: on production only once there is a reel (reel.ts). Its
// still is cut to 16:9 here, so the card and the player's placeholder show
// exactly the same picture as one grows into the other.
const showReel = Boolean(REEL_SRC) || __DEPLOYMENT__ !== 'production';
const reelStill = reelPoster || urlFor({ asset: { _id: REEL_FALLBACK_POSTER } }).width(1280).height(720).fit('crop').url();
// The marquees' words, one strip each. Two identical halves of four, each
// wider than the strip, so moving the pair by one half brings it back to
// where it started.
const promos = [
  { key: 'book', label: 'Architectural Influence Book', href: '/book', contact: false },
  { key: 'contact', label: 'Contact Tom', href: '#contact', contact: true },
];
// The contact form's single-line fields; the project's text follows them
const fields: { name: string; label: string; type: 'text' | 'email'; autocomplete: 'name' | 'organization' | 'email'; required: boolean; half?: boolean }[] = [
  { name: 'name', label: 'Name', type: 'text', autocomplete: 'name', required: true, half: true },
  { name: 'company', label: 'Company', type: 'text', autocomplete: 'organization', required: false, half: true },
  { name: 'email', label: 'Email address', type: 'email', autocomplete: 'email', required: true },
];
---
<div class="fnav-backdrop" data-fnav-backdrop aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div class:list={['fnav-menu', { 'has-reel': showReel }]} id="fnav-menu" data-fnav-menu aria-hidden="true" inert>
  <nav class="fnav-menu__nav" aria-label="Site menu">
    <ul class="fnav-menu__tiles" role="list">
      {tiles.map(({ href, label, note }) => (
        <li class="fnav-menu__cell" data-fnav-reveal data-fnav-item={href}>
          <a href={href} class="fnav-tile" data-fnav-link data-split-hover="link">
            <span class="fnav-tile__title" data-split-hover="target">{label}</span>
            <span class="fnav-tile__note">{note}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      ))}
      <li class="fnav-menu__cell is--wide" data-fnav-reveal data-fnav-item={home.href}>
        <a href={home.href} class="fnav-tile is--wide" data-fnav-link data-split-hover="link">
          <span class="fnav-tile__title" data-split-hover="target">{home.label}</span>
          <span class="fnav-tile__note">{home.note}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="fnav-menu__row">
    {showReel && (
    <div class="fnav-menu__reel" data-fnav-reveal>
      <button type="button" class="fnav-reel" data-cursor="play" data-reel-card data-reel-src={REEL_SRC} data-reel-poster={reelStill} data-reel-preview={reelPreview} data-reel-preview-small={reelPreviewSmall || undefined} aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Play the reel">
        <span class="fnav-reel__media">
          <img class="fnav-reel__still" src={reelStill} alt="" decoding="async">
          <!-- The moving preview: no source until the first hover (reel.js);
               crossorigin so the player can start from the frame it shows -->
          <video class="fnav-reel__preview" data-reel-preview-video muted loop playsinline preload="none" crossorigin="anonymous" disablepictureinpicture aria-hidden="true"></video>
        </span>
        <span class="fnav-reel__label">Play reel</span>
        <span class="fnav-reel__play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l10.5-6.5z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
      </button>
    </div>
    )}
    <a href="#contact" class="fnav-menu__contact" data-fnav-reveal data-fnav-button data-fnav-contact-open data-barba-prevent="self" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="fnav-contact" data-split-hover="link">
      <span class="fnav-menu__contact-label" data-split-hover="target">Contact Tom</span>
      <svg class="fnav-menu__contact-arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 1.5 8.5 6 4 10.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
    </a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</div>

<div class="fnav-contact" id="fnav-contact" data-fnav-contact role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="fnav-contact-title" aria-hidden="true" inert>
  <div class="fnav-contact__inner" data-fnav-contact-inner data-lenis-prevent tabindex="-1">
    <div class="fnav-contact__head" data-fnav-contact-reveal>
      <h2 class="fnav-contact__title" id="fnav-contact-title">Get in touch</h2>
      <button type="button" class="fnav-contact__close" data-fnav-contact-close aria-label="Close the contact form">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0.354 11.667 11.667 0.354" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M0.354 0.354 11.667 11.667" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="fnav-contact__lead" data-fnav-contact-reveal>Tell Tom about your project.</p>
    <form class="fnav-contact__form" data-enquiry-form data-endpoint={CONTACT_ENDPOINT} data-email={email} action={CONTACT_ENDPOINT || undefined} method="post" novalidate>
      <div class="fnav-contact__fields">
        {fields.map(({ name, label, type, autocomplete, required, half }) => (
        <div class:list={['fnav-field', { 'is--half': half }]} data-fnav-contact-reveal data-enquiry-field>
          <label class="fnav-field__label" for={`enquiry-${name}`}>{label}{required ? <span class="fnav-field__mark" aria-hidden="true"> *</span> : <span class="fnav-field__optional"> (optional)</span>}</label>
          <input class="fnav-field__input" id={`enquiry-${name}`} name={name} type={type} autocomplete={autocomplete} maxlength="256" required={required} aria-describedby={`enquiry-${name}-error`} {...(type === 'email' ? { inputmode: 'email', autocapitalize: 'off', spellcheck: 'false' } : {})}>
          <p class="fnav-field__error" id={`enquiry-${name}-error`}></p>
        </div>
        ))}
        <div class="fnav-field" data-fnav-contact-reveal data-enquiry-field>
          <label class="fnav-field__label" for="enquiry-message">Project information<span class="fnav-field__mark" aria-hidden="true"> *</span></label>
          <textarea class="fnav-field__input is--area" id="enquiry-message" name="message" rows="5" maxlength="5000" required data-minlength="10" aria-describedby="enquiry-message-error" placeholder="What you are planning, who it is for and when"></textarea>
          <p class="fnav-field__error" id="enquiry-message-error"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fnav-contact__actions" data-fnav-contact-reveal>
        <button type="submit" class="fnav-contact__submit" data-enquiry-submit>
          <span class="fnav-contact__submit-label" data-enquiry-label>Submit Enquiry</span>
          <svg class="fnav-contact__submit-arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 1.5 8.5 6 4 10.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="fnav-contact__status" data-enquiry-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
    </form>
    <div class="fnav-contact__done" data-enquiry-done hidden tabindex="-1">
      <p class="fnav-contact__done-title">Thank you.</p>
      <p class="fnav-contact__done-text">Your enquiry has been sent to Tom.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="fnav-contact__background" data-fnav-contact-bg></div>
</div>

{promos.map(({ key, label, href, contact }) => (
<a href={href} class={`fnav-promo is--${key}`} data-fnav-promo={key} aria-label={label} {...(contact ? { 'data-panel-open': 'contact', 'data-barba-prevent': 'self', 'aria-haspopup': 'dialog', 'aria-controls': 'fnav-contact' } : {})}>
  <!-- The words' layer, which the book's strip scales as it grows into the
       Influence page's book band (influence.js) -->
  <span class="fnav-promo__scale">
    <span class="fnav-promo__track" aria-hidden="true">
      {[0, 1].map(() => (
      <span class="fnav-promo__half">
        {[0, 1, 2, 3].map(() => (
        <span class="fnav-promo__item"><span class="fnav-promo__text">{label}</span>{key === 'book' ? <BookIcon /> : <span class="fnav-promo__mark"></span>}</span>
        ))}
      </span>
      ))}
    </span>
  </span>
</a>
))}

<div class="fnav" data-fnav data-cursor="hover">
  <!-- The home link: the studio's mark (BrandMark.astro) -->
  <a href="/" class="fnav__logo" aria-label="Tomrow Studios, home"><BrandMark class="fnav__logo-mark" /></a>
  <div class="fnav__title" aria-hidden="true"><div class="fnav__title-inner" data-fnav-title></div></div>
  <button type="button" class="fnav__burger" data-fnav-open aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fnav-menu">
    <svg class="fnav__burger-svg" viewBox="0 0 20 11" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0.5H20" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M0 5.5H20" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M0 10.5H20" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
  </button>
  <button type="button" class="fnav__close" data-fnav-close aria-label="Close menu">
    <svg class="fnav__close-svg" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0.354 11.667 11.667 0.354" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M0.354 0.354 11.667 11.667" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
  </button>
  <button type="button" class="fnav__arrow" data-fnav-top aria-label="Back to top">
    <svg class="fnav__arrow-svg" viewBox="0 0 11 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5.375 11.711V1.2M0.35 5.65 5.375 0.6l5.025 5.05" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
  </button>
  <span class="fnav__background" data-fnav-bg></span>
</div>
